<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN GERMAN FIRST DIVISION.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN GERMAN FIRST DIVISION.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-03-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading goalscorers in the German first division after Sunday's game:</p>
<p>16 - Bernhard Winkler (1860 Munich), Fredi Bobic (VfB Stuttgart)</p>
<p>14 - Sean Dundee (Karlsruhe), Giovane Elber (VfB Stuttgart)</p>
<p>13 - Andreas Herzog (Werder Bremen)</p>
<p>12 - Paulo Sergio (Bayer Leverkusen), Jonathan Akpoborie (Hansa Rostock)</p>
<p>11 - Ulf Kirsten (Bayer Leverkusen), Martin Max (Schalke)</p>
<p>10 - Toni Polster (Cologne), Juergen Klinsmann (Bayern Munich)</p>
</text>
